OL,3,GNEWSAMan skipping length of UK to
OL,4,A'spread joy and kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pledged to skip the length of
OL,7,Fthe UK on a mission to "prove kindness
OL,8,Fexists everywhere".
OL,10,FKrish Patel is skipping 900 miles (1148
OL,11,Fkm) from Land's End to John O'Groats -
OL,12,Fthe equivalent of 40 marathons in 40
OL,13,Fdays - during his Great British Skip
OL,14,Fchallenge.
OL,16,FThe 34-year-old, from Bolton, Greater
OL,17,FManchester, said he was inspired after
OL,18,Fseeing skipping children "laughing with
OL,19,Fjoy" while he was volunteering at
OL,20,Fschools in Uganda and Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
