OL,3,GNEWSAMan skipping length of UK to
OL,4,A'spread joy and kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It clearly brings smiles, it brings
OL,7,Fjoy so I thought, you know what, what
OL,8,Fabout if I skip the length of the UK
OL,9,Fwith a skipping rope," he told BBC
OL,10,FRadio Manchester.
